  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Gavel Improvements</em></p>\n<p>Your attunement with <em>Deadly Sentencing</em> has allowed you to summon Judgeman outside the domain. As a bonus action for 5 Cursed Energy, you summon Judgeman for 1 minute. Every time your opponent attacks you, they are penalized for assault and the opponent gains a -1 penalty to attack rolls and saving throws. If a creature targets you with a cursed technique that is not an attack roll, they gain a -1 penalty to their CE save DC. These penalties last until Judgeman disappears.</p>",
